{
  "uid": "local-torrent",
  "title": "Torrent downloads",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"},
  "tags": ["torrent", "downloads"],
  "panels": [
    {"id": 1, "title": "Скачано (период)", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "Суммарный payload, скачанный за выбранный период.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "noValue": "Нет данных"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(torrent_downloaded_bytes_total[$__range]))"}]},
    {"id": 2, "title": "Отдано (период)", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 4, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "Payload, отданный в сидирование за выбранный период.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "noValue": "Нет данных"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(torrent_uploaded_bytes_total[$__range]))"}]},
    {"id": 3, "title": "Загрузки (период)", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "По результату: started, completed, failed, cancelled.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "noValue": "Нет данных"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by(result)(increase(torrent_downloads_total[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{result}}"}]},
    {"id": 4, "title": "Скачиваются сейчас", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "noValue": "0"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "torrent_active_downloads"}]},
    {"id": 5, "title": "Сидируется", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "noValue": "0"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "torrent_seeding"}]},
    {"id": 6, "title": "Свободно на диске", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 20, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "Свободное место в каталоге назначения; алерт при < 5%.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "noValue": "Нет данных", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 1073741824}, {"color": "green", "value": 10737418240}]}}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "torrent_destination_free_bytes"}]},
    {"id": 7, "title": "Скорость скачивания", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "Суммарная скорость по всем активным загрузкам (payload, без oверхеда).", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "Bps"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(torrent_download_speed_bytes_per_second)", "legendFormat": "download"}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "sum(torrent_upload_speed_bytes_per_second)", "legendFormat": "upload (seeding)"}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}},
    {"id": 8, "title": "Загрузки по результату (rate)", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "req/s"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by(result)(rate(torrent_downloads_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{result}}"}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}},
    {"id": 9, "title": "Средняя скорость загрузок", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "Одно наблюдение на завершённую загрузку — её средняя скорость. mean — среднее по загрузкам за период, p50 — медиана по всем.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "Bps"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(torrent_download_avg_speed_bytes_per_second_sum[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(torrent_download_avg_speed_bytes_per_second_count[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "mean"}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by(le)(rate(torrent_download_avg_speed_bytes_per_second_bucket[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p50 (median)"}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}},
    {"id": 10, "title": "Длительность загрузок", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(torrent_download_duration_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(torrent_download_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "mean"}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le)(rate(torrent_download_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p95"}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}},
    {"id": 11, "title": "Размер загрузок", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(torrent_download_size_bytes_sum[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(torrent_download_size_bytes_count[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "mean"}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by(le)(rate(torrent_download_size_bytes_bucket[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p50"}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}},
    {"id": 12, "title": "Получение метаданных (rate)", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "description": "ok — метаданы получены, timeout — сиды не нашлись за лимит, error, duplicate.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "req/s"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by(result)(rate(torrent_metadata_fetches_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{result}}"}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}},
    {"id": 13, "title": "Место на диске назначения", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 28, "w": 24, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes"}, "overrides": []}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "torrent_destination_total_bytes", "legendFormat": "total"}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "torrent_destination_total_bytes - torrent_destination_free_bytes", "legendFormat": "used"}, {"refId": "C", "expr": "torrent_destination_free_bytes", "legendFormat": "free"}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}},
    {"id": 14, "type": "text", "title": "Как читать показатели", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 36, "w": 24, "h": 5}, "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "Скачивание запускается из Telegram-бота командой `/magnet <ссылка>` (только администратор): бот показывает имя и размер, после подтверждения торрент скачивается в `outputs/torrent`. `Скачано/Отдано` — payload за период; после перезапуска контейнера счётчики сбрасываются. «Средняя скорость загрузок» — одно наблюдение на завершённую загрузку (её средняя скорость): `mean` — среднее по загрузкам, `p50` — медиана по всем. «Свободно на диске» — каталог назначения; при < 5% Prometheus поднимает алерт `TorrentDestinationLow`. Логи сервиса — в dashboard логов (модель `torrent`)."}}
  ],
  "links": [{"title": "Telegram bot", "type": "link", "url": "/d/local-tgbot", "keepTime": true}, {"title": "Market scraper", "type": "link", "url": "/d/local-scraper", "keepTime": true}, {"title": "Model logs", "type": "link", "url": "/d/local-llm-logs", "keepTime": true}]
}
